---
// 右上角「切換身份」：任何頁面都能換到另一個入口，或回首頁看事件始末
import { personas, type PersonaId } from '../data/personas';

interface Props { current?: PersonaId }
const { current } = Astro.props;
---
<details class="transfer">
  <summary>
    <span class="transfer__dots" aria-hidden="true">
      {personas.map((p) => <i data-line={p.id}></i>)}
    </span>
    切換身份
  </summary>
  <ul>
    {personas.map((p) => (
      <li>
        <a href={p.href} data-line={p.id} aria-current={current === p.id ? 'page' : undefined}>
          <span class="transfer__badge num">{p.exit}</span>
          <span class="transfer__name">{p.name}</span>
          <span class="transfer__line">{p.line}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    ))}
    <li>
      <a href="/#what-happened" data-line="story" aria-current={current === 'news' ? 'page' : undefined}>
        <span class="transfer__badge" aria-hidden="true">?</span>
        <span class="transfer__name">事件始末</span>
        <span class="transfer__line">懶人包・時間軸</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</details>

<style>
  .transfer { position: relative; }
  summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border: 2px solid var(--on-graphite);
    color: var(--on-graphite);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .transfer[open] summary { background: var(--on-graphite); color: var(--graphite); }
  .transfer__dots { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; }
  .transfer__dots i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); }
  [data-line='basic'] { --c: var(--line-basic); }
  [data-line='dev'] { --c: var(--line-dev); }
  [data-line='story'] { --c: var(--on-graphite-soft); }

  ul {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: calc(100% + 8px);
    z-index: 20;
    min-width: 280px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    background: var(--graphite);
    border: 2px solid var(--on-graphite);
  }
  li + li { border-top: 1px solid var(--graphite-rule); }
  ul a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    color: var(--on-graphite);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-top: 6px solid var(--c);
  }
  ul a:hover, ul a[aria-current='page'] { background: var(--graphite-2); }
  .transfer__badge {
    width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: var(--c); color: var(--on-line);
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  .transfer__name { font-weight: 800; }
  .transfer__line { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--on-graphite-soft); }
</style>
